"van je app."

#: src/ui/login.rs:461
msgid "Set up your Spotify app"
msgstr "Stel je Spotify-app in"

#: src/ui/login.rs:469
msgid ""
"Spotifast signs in through your own free Spotify app. Spotify requires its "
"owner to have Premium."
msgstr ""
"Spotifast logt in via je eigen gratis Spotify-app. Spotify vereist dat de "
"eigenaar Premium heeft."

